   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FRAME & CANVAS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 4, CC 1 to 16\n   1 Punch-in and reframe\n   2 Mirror and rotate\n   3 Steadying\n   4 Canvas edges\n   5 Fake camera move\n   6 3D frame move\n   7 Focus changed in the edit\n   8 Frame within a frame\n   9 Seen through a screen\n  10 Breaking out of the frame\n  11 The closing circle\n  12 suite: Kaleidoscope\n  13 suite: Boxed in\n  14 suite: Silent film homage\n  15 suite: Comic book frame\n  16 pair: When the joke pays off, the editor punches in\nCV-CC 2: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 4, CC 17 to 25\n   1 pair: When the camera goes handheld, the shake is left in\n   2 pair: When impacts rise, the editor slam zooms\n   3 pair: When the frame spins like a cube, the pace jumps\n   4 pair: When the picture is tilted, the tension rises\n   5 pair: When someone is boxed in by a frame, loneliness grows\n   6 pair: When we watch through a security camera, dread rises\n   7 pair: When the black bars are thick, something breaks out of them\n   8 pair: When the circle closes in, the scene ends\n   9 pairs: The editor tells the joke"
   },
   "pos": [
